# a11y.ts

- Pure ARIA/keyboard helpers. No DOM, no React components.
- Prefer declarative maps + `applyA11y(spec, state)` for boolean states.
- Use functions when values need context (`open`, ids).
- Export `*A11ySpec` or named helpers; consume once from the part tsx.
